1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Forty-Third Episode
The Spider Island

15
00:02:17,421 --> 00:02:18,900
Hey!

16
00:02:38,741 --> 00:02:42,575
But this is a ship in the shape
of a swan! How big and beautiful it is!

17
00:02:42,741 --> 00:02:45,130
I'll run to the castle right away
to tell Sapphire!

18
00:02:52,141 --> 00:02:55,850
Sapphire, wake up! In the lake
there's a beautiful swan-ship!

19
00:02:58,941 --> 00:03:02,729
- Look! Isn't it magnificent?
- A swan-ship?!

20
00:03:04,381 --> 00:03:07,498
It's a strange shape for a ship.
I wonder who it belongs to..!

21
00:03:07,541 --> 00:03:09,816
Come on, let's go see it up close.

22
00:03:18,701 --> 00:03:21,010
I'd like to try to get on board.

23
00:03:21,741 --> 00:03:23,732
Please, come aboard if you like!

24
00:03:23,781 --> 00:03:26,090
Grand Duke Duralumin
had this ship built..

25
00:03:26,141 --> 00:03:29,019
...specially for you, Prince.
You may come aboard!

26
00:03:29,061 --> 00:03:31,859
You know, the Grand Duke is very keen
on you having a good time!

27
00:03:33,261 --> 00:03:35,775
It's a bit strange
that the Grand Duke desires this,

28
00:03:35,821 --> 00:03:37,937
but the ship is inviting.

29
00:03:38,461 --> 00:03:41,021
I hope you will come aboard,
Prince.

30
00:03:41,541 --> 00:03:44,374
Very well, we will go on board
and have a look.

31
00:03:53,021 --> 00:03:55,455
My dear little son!

32
00:03:55,501 --> 00:03:58,937
You know, Plastic, I have a wonderful
gift for you.

33
00:03:59,221 --> 00:04:01,018
A sweet?

34
00:04:01,061 --> 00:04:04,019
I would never give you
such an insignificant gift.

35
00:04:04,061 --> 00:04:07,053
The whole of Silverland will be yours,
tomorrow!

36
00:04:07,501 --> 00:04:10,095
Have you seen
that beautiful swan-ship?

37
00:04:10,141 --> 00:04:12,814
As soon as Sapphire
sets foot on it,

38
00:04:12,861 --> 00:04:16,058
it will sail towards the lonely
island of roses!

39
00:04:16,101 --> 00:04:17,853
Who is it?

40
00:04:18,101 --> 00:04:21,332
- Ah, it's you!
- Everything is going for the best

41
00:04:21,381 --> 00:04:24,020
- Magnificent!
- Everything is ready.

42
00:04:24,061 --> 00:04:27,019
We have scrupulously followed
your instructions.

43
00:04:27,101 --> 00:04:29,774
The ship was built
as you commanded.

44
00:04:30,421 --> 00:04:32,571
Also the work on the island
has been completed...

45
00:04:32,621 --> 00:04:34,339
...according to your orders.

46
00:04:34,701 --> 00:04:37,261
The Princess will disappear
on the deserted island...

47
00:04:37,301 --> 00:04:40,532
...and no one will notice.
Then everything will go according to plan.

48
00:04:40,581 --> 00:04:42,299
Good!

49
00:04:44,021 --> 00:04:46,455
That ship is really beautiful!

50
00:04:52,821 --> 00:04:56,336
How nice! It would be fun
to take a trip on this ship!

51
00:04:56,381 --> 00:04:58,372
We could sail for a long time.

52
00:05:13,021 --> 00:05:16,491
Look, Tink! The ship has set sail!
It's sailing by itself!

53
00:05:17,981 --> 00:05:20,893
Help! Help!

54
00:05:21,821 --> 00:05:25,609
- Save us! Help!
- Hey! Hey!

55
00:05:26,381 --> 00:05:28,053
Who's shouting?

56
00:05:29,261 --> 00:05:32,651
Help! Help!

57
00:05:33,261 --> 00:05:34,899
But it's Sapphire!

58
00:05:40,021 --> 00:05:43,252
Franz! Franz!
Please, help us!

59
00:05:55,181 --> 00:05:57,934
- Prince Franz!
- Help, Franz!

60
00:06:08,781 --> 00:06:10,897
Unfortunately, he can't do anything

61
00:06:17,740 --> 00:06:21,131
Sapphire, the rudder isn't working!

62
00:06:24,420 --> 00:06:26,537
We almost crashed!

63
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:43,011
Franz followed us
onto the cliff!

64
00:06:43,060 --> 00:06:45,256
Sapphire, I'll try to save you!

65
00:06:48,700 --> 00:06:50,498
How brave he is!

66
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:11,170
I'm happy
to be able to be near you.

67
00:07:18,660 --> 00:07:20,219
It's raining...

68
00:07:22,340 --> 00:07:24,218
What a downpour!

69
00:07:25,300 --> 00:07:27,895
Why don't you come under here
to take shelter?

70
00:07:30,700 --> 00:07:33,169
It's all the same,
we're fine here too.

71
00:07:57,260 --> 00:08:01,049
What a magnificent island this is!
It's full of roses!

72
00:08:07,780 --> 00:08:11,490
But there's something strange...
These roses are truly beautiful,

73
00:08:11,540 --> 00:08:14,339
- but they don't smell at all.
- This island is strange, too.

74
00:08:14,380 --> 00:08:16,451
Let's try to find out why.

75
00:08:22,420 --> 00:08:24,810
Look, a tunnel of roses!

76
00:08:35,060 --> 00:08:38,770
Hey! Wait! Wait, hat!

77
00:08:45,861 --> 00:08:48,659
Where did Tink go?
He was right behind us!

78
00:08:50,941 --> 00:08:53,535
Tink! Tink!

79
00:08:53,901 --> 00:08:56,210
- Tink!
- Tink, where are you?

80
00:08:56,261 --> 00:08:59,412
Tink, answer me! Tink!

81
00:09:03,341 --> 00:09:05,809
Look, Franz: the roses!

82
00:09:10,141 --> 00:09:12,575
Sapphire, watch out!
There's something strange.

83
00:09:15,621 --> 00:09:18,818
- Look, Franz!
- And what do these cats want?

84
00:09:23,821 --> 00:09:25,812
Sapphire, take cover behind me!

85
00:09:25,861 --> 00:09:28,500
If they want to harm us,
I will face them with my sword.

86
00:09:28,781 --> 00:09:31,898
I don't believe they are just cats.
Perhaps they are evil spirits.

87
00:09:32,861 --> 00:09:34,613
I will fight too!

88
00:09:34,661 --> 00:09:36,458
There's no need, leave it to me.

89
00:09:39,821 --> 00:09:41,812
Watch out, they're circling us!

90
00:10:12,941 --> 00:10:16,172
- Franz!
- Sapphire!

91
00:10:33,341 --> 00:10:36,139
Franz!
The cats are tearing my dress!

92
00:10:44,421 --> 00:10:46,218
Sapphire!

93
00:10:49,341 --> 00:10:51,013
What is this?

94
00:11:13,781 --> 00:11:16,898
The mysterious knight
is not afraid of you, you nasty cats!

95
00:11:53,581 --> 00:11:56,095
But where could Franz have ended up
now?

96
00:11:56,661 --> 00:11:58,811
Franz, where are you?

97
00:11:59,261 --> 00:12:01,377
Franz, answer me!

98
00:12:01,501 --> 00:12:04,334
Franz! Tink! Where are you?

99
00:12:04,381 --> 00:12:06,611
Answer, quick!

100
00:12:06,661 --> 00:12:09,573
- Franz! Tink!
- Sapphire!

101
00:12:10,381 --> 00:12:12,815
But you are the mysterious knight!

102
00:12:12,861 --> 00:12:15,853
- Don't worry, I'll free you now.
- Thank you.

103
00:12:16,901 --> 00:12:19,893
Perhaps Prince Franz
has also been captured by the cats.

104
00:12:20,221 --> 00:12:22,815
You can't say that this
is a normal island.

105
00:12:22,861 --> 00:12:25,011
I let myself get caught
like a fool!

106
00:12:25,061 --> 00:12:27,052
I'll take care of looking for Franz

107
00:12:27,941 --> 00:12:31,138
But how will you look for him
on such a dangerous island?

108
00:12:31,181 --> 00:12:33,172
I'll find him, you'll see!

109
00:12:35,861 --> 00:12:39,820
How strange...! This spiderweb
is as thick as a rope.

110
00:12:40,221 --> 00:12:42,257
I must find out who made it

111
00:13:01,181 --> 00:13:03,411
Have you lost consciousness, Franz?

112
00:13:03,781 --> 00:13:06,090
Who are you?
Why have you captured me?

113
00:13:11,541 --> 00:13:16,410
You want to know who I am? I am
the Spider-Man, master of the island.

114
00:13:16,581 --> 00:13:20,210
I was waiting for you, because I knew
the swan ship had set sail.

115
00:13:20,261 --> 00:13:24,095
My master ordered me
to kill Princess Sapphire!

116
00:13:25,461 --> 00:13:28,851
But I didn't expect her
lover to be with her!

117
00:13:30,021 --> 00:13:33,377
So, at this point,
I’ll get rid of you first!

118
00:13:35,061 --> 00:13:38,053
So it was all a
prearranged plan, wasn't it?

119
00:13:40,181 --> 00:13:44,732
Exactly! That's why you'll share
the fate of your dear Princess!

120
00:13:45,501 --> 00:13:47,810
You should be happy, shouldn't you?

121
00:14:27,901 --> 00:14:29,619
Franz!

122
00:14:30,021 --> 00:14:32,012
The mysterious knight!

123
00:14:32,101 --> 00:14:34,012
I've come to save you.

124
00:14:34,701 --> 00:14:37,579
Dammit,
this rope won't break!

125
00:14:37,621 --> 00:14:39,339
It's no ordinary rope.

126
00:14:39,381 --> 00:14:42,020
I have an idea, Tink! Look
for some water somewhere!

127
00:14:42,061 --> 00:14:45,690
- Right away!
- What happened to Princess Sapphire?

128
00:14:46,221 --> 00:14:49,054
Sapphire is doing just
fine, don't worry about her.

129
00:14:50,101 --> 00:14:52,251
Thank goodness! But
you, mysterious knight,

130
00:14:52,301 --> 00:14:54,292
Why do you always
appear when she isn't here?

131
00:14:54,341 --> 00:14:56,411
There's no time
now to discuss this.

132
00:14:56,461 --> 00:14:59,021
We have to escape from here
while the spider-man is sleeping.

133
00:14:59,061 --> 00:15:01,575
I found the water, but
what do you need it for?

134
00:15:01,621 --> 00:15:03,339
Pour it on him!

135
00:15:04,741 --> 00:15:07,414
See? Now let's run! Quick!

136
00:15:12,581 --> 00:15:14,537
The boy has escaped!

137
00:15:15,821 --> 00:15:17,857
I'll catch him again!

138
00:15:26,701 --> 00:15:28,373
I can't go on anymore!

139
00:15:29,261 --> 00:15:31,297
Come on, Tink, or he'll catch us!

140
00:15:31,341 --> 00:15:34,014
You go on ahead, I'm too tired!

141
00:15:55,461 --> 00:15:58,498
A scratch will be enough
with these poisoned stilettos...

142
00:15:58,541 --> 00:16:00,611
...to make you lose your life!

143
00:16:03,301 --> 00:16:05,417
And now for the two of you!

144
00:16:22,621 --> 00:16:25,181
Franz is wounded and the
poison is starting to take effect.

145
00:16:25,221 --> 00:16:27,655
- What do you plan to do?
- We must leave here immediately.

146
00:16:27,701 --> 00:16:29,737
And we must look for the antidote!

147
00:16:41,901 --> 00:16:44,051
I'll make you pay for my wound!

148
00:17:02,461 --> 00:17:05,578
Tink, I've heard that
where an evil monster lives...

149
00:17:05,621 --> 00:17:07,930
...a plant grows that
neutralizes the poison.

150
00:17:07,981 --> 00:17:11,371
Try looking around here. Maybe
you'll be able to find this plant.

151
00:17:11,901 --> 00:17:13,732
Yes, I'll find it for sure!

152
00:17:14,781 --> 00:17:17,853
- Oh, Sapphire...
- Yes, I'm here.

153
00:17:19,421 --> 00:17:21,412
- Sapphire... Sapphire!
- The fever is making him delirious.

154
00:17:21,461 --> 00:17:24,817
Poor Franz! If we don't
find the antidote, he will die

155
00:17:24,861 --> 00:17:26,658
Don't worry, Franz!

156
00:17:26,701 --> 00:17:29,261
The mysterious knight
will try once more.

157
00:18:01,941 --> 00:18:03,852
Courage, Franz!

158
00:18:05,581 --> 00:18:07,333
Sapphire!

159
00:18:09,701 --> 00:18:13,091
I am beside you. Don't worry,
Franz, you'll be saved!

160
00:18:13,461 --> 00:18:15,338
Thank you, Sapphire.

161
00:18:31,341 --> 00:18:33,093
Here is the herb! I found it!

162
00:18:33,141 --> 00:18:35,780
It will remove the effect of the
Spider-Man's poison!

163
00:18:35,821 --> 00:18:38,210
But how?
Have you returned again, Sapphire?

164
00:18:38,261 --> 00:18:40,013
Shut up!

165
00:18:40,061 --> 00:18:42,017
- Give me the plant immediately.
- Here it is!

166
00:18:42,221 --> 00:18:44,610
Let's hope
it really works..

167
00:18:49,461 --> 00:18:51,531
Now he should recover.

168
00:18:56,101 --> 00:18:58,899
There are no excuses
that will hold up!

169
00:18:58,941 --> 00:19:02,013
Of course I didn't foresee that
Franz would come here too,

170
00:19:02,061 --> 00:19:05,451
but you're a professional! You cannot
be defeated by a boy!

171
00:19:05,501 --> 00:19:07,298
He hasn't beaten me yet!

172
00:19:07,341 --> 00:19:09,935
Besides, I wounded him
with the poisoned stiletto..

173
00:19:09,981 --> 00:19:15,260
...when he pierced me. By now
the poison will have already taken effect.

174
00:19:15,421 --> 00:19:19,050
I am here to receive from you
Sapphire's body!

175
00:19:19,701 --> 00:19:22,090
This is the promise
that you made me.

176
00:19:22,141 --> 00:19:25,372
Are you so inept as to retreat
over a small wound?

177
00:19:26,261 --> 00:19:30,049
Go and kill Sapphire with
the web you are so proud of!

178
00:19:30,101 --> 00:19:34,413
I will return to the island as soon
as I know she has been finished off!

179
00:19:34,541 --> 00:19:36,418
Go now!

180
00:19:49,301 --> 00:19:51,417
Where did Sapphire go?

181
00:19:52,741 --> 00:19:54,891
What? Sapphire was here?!

182
00:19:55,341 --> 00:19:58,777
Yes! She was beside me and
tended to me all night long.

183
00:19:58,821 --> 00:20:02,450
Tink has already sent her
home flying on the back of a swan.

184
00:20:03,021 --> 00:20:05,012
But then it wasn't her last night!

185
00:20:05,061 --> 00:20:07,336
You must have dreamed of
her in your feverish delirium.

186
00:20:07,381 --> 00:20:10,020
Now the two of us must
think about repairing the ship.

187
00:20:10,061 --> 00:20:12,017
Rest a bit more.

188
00:20:19,301 --> 00:20:21,371
Now the rudder works!

189
00:20:22,381 --> 00:20:25,259
I fixed the hull.
We can set off again.

190
00:20:26,581 --> 00:20:30,415
No, you can't!
Princess Sapphire, I will kill you!

191
00:20:30,461 --> 00:20:33,055
- Spider-Man!
- You are dressed in strange clothes

192
00:20:33,101 --> 00:20:35,012
but it's you, Sapphire, isn't it?

193
00:20:36,501 --> 00:20:38,810
No, I am
the mysterious knight!

194
00:20:38,861 --> 00:20:42,695
It doesn't matter! Whoever you are,
I won't leave you alive!

195
00:20:43,821 --> 00:20:46,289
You, my friends,
take care of the brat.

196
00:20:53,021 --> 00:20:54,739
Help!

197
00:20:55,141 --> 00:20:57,097
I'll show you!

198
00:21:21,301 --> 00:21:23,178
I'm not afraid of you..!

199
00:21:23,741 --> 00:21:27,211
I have a very powerful drug,
that you will like and that will make you sleep!

200
00:21:48,181 --> 00:21:49,819
Take that!

201
00:21:55,021 --> 00:21:57,899
It's the end for me!

202
00:22:04,341 --> 00:22:06,901
- Tink, are you okay?
- Yes!

203
00:22:06,941 --> 00:22:10,695
The cats ate a drug
and now they are sleeping soundly.

204
00:22:15,741 --> 00:22:19,734
Curse it, I didn't make it!
But it doesn't end here!

205
00:22:19,781 --> 00:22:23,012
I won't give up so easily,
you little pests!

206
00:22:23,221 --> 00:22:25,451
I will manage to kill you, Sapphire

207
00:22:25,501 --> 00:22:28,334
and seize the throne,
sooner or later!

208
00:22:42,301 --> 00:22:44,815
Sapphire, I will never forget...

209
00:22:44,861 --> 00:22:47,250
...how sweet you were
taking care of me,

210
00:22:47,341 --> 00:22:49,809
even if they say
that it was a dream

211
00:22:49,861 --> 00:22:52,819
Franz, I'm glad
that you said it.

212
00:23:29,821 --> 00:23:33,441
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

213
00:23:33,442 --> 00:23:36,802
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

214
00:23:36,803 --> 00:23:40,573
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

215
00:23:40,574 --> 00:23:43,735
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

216
00:23:43,736 --> 00:23:47,549
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

217
00:23:47,550 --> 00:23:50,846
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

218
00:23:50,847 --> 00:23:54,852
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

219
00:23:54,853 --> 00:23:58,291
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

220
00:23:58,292 --> 00:24:01,912
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

221
00:24:01,913 --> 00:24:05,273
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

222
00:24:05,274 --> 00:24:09,044
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

223
00:24:09,045 --> 00:24:12,206
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

224
00:24:12,230 --> 00:24:23,777
